<title>USA: Smith Barney Disciplined to convert fund. [CORRECTED 21:14 GMT]</title>
<headline>Smith Barney Disciplined to convert fund. [CORRECTED 21:14 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Disciplined Small Cap Fund Inc said on Thursday that it would convert from a closed-end to an open-end fund, no longer trading on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The conversion is effective at the open of business on June 23, the fund said.</p>
<p>(Corrects from &quot;... at the close of business&quot;)</p>
</text>
